{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_cofounder_project", "label": "Cofounder (CLAUDE.md project guide)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One founder runs a company through a hierarchy of AI agents in typed, threaded department channels without becoming the approval bottleneck; optimize for a demoable vertical slice over breadth."}, {"id": "claude_inv_agents_never_execute", "label": "Invariant: Agents never execute", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Role agents only propose actions inside envelopes; only Convex executes (Nessie directly, connectors via the Executor)."}, {"id": "claude_inv_gate_is_code", "label": "Invariant: The gate is code", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "evaluateGate is one deterministic transactional Convex mutation; LLMs may produce labels as inputs but never the decision."}, {"id": "claude_inv_only_dispatcher_triggers", "label": "Invariant: Only the Dispatcher triggers agents", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Agents never address each other; every inter-agent message is a Convex record delivered by the Dispatcher as a new run."}, {"id": "claude_inv_every_message_validated", "label": "Invariant: Every agent message is validated", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Invalid envelope gets one repair request in the same thread, then an ISSUE to the manager."}, {"id": "claude_inv_budgets_in_gate_txn", "label": "Invariant: Budgets decremented inside the gate transaction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never check a budget in one function and spend it in another (avoids races)."}, {"id": "claude_inv_keys_in_convex_env", "label": "Invariant: Keys live only in Convex env vars", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Creao Secrets are account-scoped so every agent would see them; never frontend or logs."}, {"id": "claude_inv_everything_audited", "label": "Invariant: Everything is audited (audit_log)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_inv_graph_limits", "label": "Invariant: Graph limits (hop limit 3, no self-role tasks, max 3 handoffs)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_evaluategate", "label": "evaluateGate (deterministic gate mutation)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_dispatcher", "label": "Dispatcher (Convex role that starts agent runs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A role in Convex code, not a Creao user; one run per task step; every ASSIGN starts with [Dispatcher]."}, {"id": "claude_creao_api_trigger", "label": "Creao API Trigger (POST /api/v1/runs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "s